BT /F1 11 Tf 13.2 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 750 Tm (Thermal-Aware Scheduling for Edge Inference) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 735 Tm (Authors: Ines Duarte and Kofi Asante \(fictional authors; synthetic evaluation paper\).) Tj T* ET
