stream
1 0 0 1 0 0 cm  BT /F1 12 Tf 14.4 TL ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 13.2 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 750 Tm (Results) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 735 Tm (Across the three devices, p95 latency fell by 23% relative to first-come-first-served.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 720 Tm (Throttling events dropped from 41 to 9 per hour on average across the three devices.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 705 Tm (Energy per inference rose by 4% because deferred jobs later ran at higher clock speeds.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 690 Tm (The phone SoC showed the largest latency gain, a 31% reduction of p95 latency.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 675 Tm (The single-board computer improved by 27%, with most gains during long bursts.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 660 Tm (Median latency changed by less than 2% on every device, so the gain lies in the tail.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 645 Tm (Forecast error stayed below 1.5 degrees Celsius for 95% of the prediction windows.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 630 Tm (The scheduler itself used less than 1% of processor time on each of the devices.) Tj T* ET
.6 g
0 g
 
endstream
endobj
16 0 obj
<<
/Length 1002
>>
stream
1 0 0 1 0 0 cm  BT /F1 12 Tf 14.4 TL ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 13.2 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 750 Tm (Discussion) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 735 Tm (The drone controller benefited least, with a 9% latency reduction.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 720 Tm (Its cooling was already adequate, so the chip rarely approached the threshold.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 705 Tm (Longer forecast horizons made the scheduler defer too many jobs in our trials.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 690 Tm (A threshold below 78 degrees Celsius reduced throttling further but hurt throughput.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 675 Tm (Results may differ for workloads with large batches or for devices with active fans.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 660 Tm (We did not study multi-tenant settings where several models share one device.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 645 Tm (Integrating the forecaster into the kernel governor is left for future work.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 630 Tm (The measurements cover a single ambient temperature, which limits generality.) Tj T* ET
.6 g
0 g
 
endstream
