1 0 0 1 0 0 cm  BT /F1 12 Tf 14.4 TL ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 13.2 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 750 Tm (Conclusion) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 735 Tm (Forecast-driven deferral keeps tail latency predictable on thermally limited devices.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 720 Tm (The approach needs only a small linear model and a priority queue per device.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 705 Tm (References) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 690 Tm ([1] P. Laine. Dynamic Thermal Management for Mobile Processors. 2023.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 675 Tm ([2] G. Ortiz. Tail Latency on Embedded Inference Hardware. 2024.) Tj T* ET
